# Cumulative scale on successive presses in the SAME direction, as specified:
#   1st press 1 s, 2nd 10 s, 3rd 30 s, 4th 60 s, 5th 120 s,
#   6th and beyond 240 s (clamped to the last entry).
# Each accepted press jumps exactly the current rung, then advances the rung.
# The index returns to the first rung after SEEK_RESET_AFTER without a press,
# or as soon as the direction changes (LEFT after RIGHT).
